{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ck9xij","slideIndex":0,"text":"Good morning. We are Team EUREKA. ClimateGuard AI is an India-focused web-based application for climate-risk awareness, geographic hazard exploration and preparedness learning. We also demonstrate source-backed monitoring and a simulated response workflow. Source: supplied ClimateGuard_AI_Resilience_Blueprint.pptx, slides 14–18. These slides describe a concept, not proof of validated operational performance."}
