{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/j4zcj8","slideIndex":4,"text":"The contribution is an integrated educational workflow, rather than a claim that disaster platforms did not previously exist. SACHET already aggregates official warnings. Our prototype combines local learning, map exploration, source freshness and simulated report handling. We have not established global novelty, validated scoring, superior alert accuracy, or measured improvement over existing services. All dashboard risk scores must be described as demonstration values. Source: supplied slides 14–18; README.md; docs/LIVE_OPERATIONS.md; https://sachet.ndma.gov.in/ ."}
