{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/nxx7st","slideIndex":7,"text":"Demonstrate the application locally with npm run dev at http://localhost:5173. The launcher also starts the adapted God's Eye View runtime on localhost:4173. Follow one story: select Kolkata, inspect source and timestamp, create a clearly labelled demo report, review it, assign a demo team, resolve it and inspect the activity history. Do not claim this is deployed publicly. The image is an existing repository verification screenshot dated 14 September 2026, not today's live feed. It shows the embedded Live View integration and simulation banner. Source image: artifacts/live-view-redesign.png, described in artifacts/README.md. Upstream attribution: https://github.com/bilawalsidhu/gods-eye-view (MIT). Educational screens still have placeholders; current scope is a local lab prototype, not validated operational deployment."}
